          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": " per range, and might get them into trouble if the marked location is in a different dimension. \n\nIn those cases, a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritual of Return",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " would be the better choice."
        }
